Package: metRscreen
Title: Title and Abstract Screening for Meta-Analyses and Systematic Reviews
Version: 0.0.1.0000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Edward R.", "Ivimey-Cook", , "e.ivimeycook@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4910-0443")),
    person("Joel L.", "Pick", , "joel.l.pick@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6295-3742"))
  )
Description: Provides a Shiny application for screening papers by title and
    abstract, with highlighting of keywords in multiple colours, user-defined
    rejection reasons, and resumable sessions. Accepts references exported from
    Zotero in CSV or RIS format.
